{
  "id": "LUK.6",
  "number": "6",
  "bookId": "LUK",
  "reference": "Luka 6",
  "verseCount": 49,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "6",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "LUK 6"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "6",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Iita Sabaato",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 6:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eaweeda Sabaato damanda beawa gwasik jeesinga madameega, hean ghwalajaada ginealangaaschi muschoonga, ak gang'ealng'ealsa jeesinga baneaguuka nyaawa ak ghwaak. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.6.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.6.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 6:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwayeesha Farisaayajeega mwaatkwa, “Ghwasaan anda goosinyi ng'asheanda mwadoabiiwa eaweeda sabaato?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.6.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.6.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 6:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwasha Yesu nea gwayeesha, “Miyoasoamwana gidaghayi sin Dawdi iiyeachih. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.6.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.6.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 6:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gidabeada jeeda gheeda ASEETA, ak gageanu ak ghwaak mukaatajeega siyiin madeeda ASEETA, nea mwadoabiiwa aba hichpa siinuut geaghus ghwaak ashoohoodiga, ak ghoadaw eara fuga mideayi sea niny?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.6.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.6.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 6:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gwayeesha, “Orjeeda Siida Ng'utamiida sabaatohi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.6.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.6.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Siida aptu geatinda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 6:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.6.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.6.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 6:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eaweecha nuut bea sabaato, damanda beawa jeeda ghooriida siinealshacheewa ak goonealshi, gwanda jeeni siisi aptu geatinda dugwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.6.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.6.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 6:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gang'ula Ng'oorshoodiga ea Farisaayajeega eadaa ea jea ghoahaap siidida eaweeda sabaato, aba sareani geegasa gichea eanyasta ramaseanda jea eahaaktaawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.6.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.6.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 6:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghwanal gidamida jeesinga nyaawa, ak gwayeesha siidida aptu geatindean, “Beeni miinaada aba hiji.” Ak ghang'eat ak ghamiinaada aba hoowa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.6.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.6.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 6:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gwayeesha Yesu, “Gaydaanyaasheagwa, aba eaweeda sabaato, ghwadoabiiwi gideaba geesin ng'asheanda miyi ghana ng'asheanda muy. Ghang'wana giighuuyda eaweega ghana ng'wana lakuunooda?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.6.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.6.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 6:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata ghoaduup ghaang' buuneeda aba murdajeega sean ak gwayeesha siidida, “Asi adoabiiwa geatindaang'u.” Hean ghoadoabiiw ak gabiikta geatinda gamajeegiit. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.6.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.6.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 6:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwanyareas muuchi fugiga ak geebalool eegasa gichea eehinda Yesu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.6.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.6.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yesu ghwaloat giijasoodi damaniyeenya",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 6:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.6.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.6.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 6:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Askwearjoojigiga gawa iheenga heayeeniga ghamwaash ASEETA; ghamwaash ASEETA eaweesean. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.6.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.6.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 6:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iimuchu, Gaguursa ginealangaaschi, ak ghwaloat damaniyeenya aba jeenyaawa, ak gaguura malaykajeega; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.6.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.6.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 6:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea Simoneeda siguura gheawungaaschi Betarohi, ea orjeeda ghaamwat siyi Andreya, ea Yakobo ea Yohana, ea Filipo, ea Bartolomayo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.6.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.6.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 6:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ea Matayo, ea Domaso, ea Yakobo orjeeda Alfayo, ea Simoneeda siguura Selote, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.6.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.6.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 6:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ea Yuda orjeeda Yakobo, ea Yudayda Iskariyoti, was siida amadu ghwala bwadaw.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.6.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.6.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yesu goonealshi nea ghoahaap fuga miyeani",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 6:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.6.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.6.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 6:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu nea ghwararang'aan sea saawa ak ghamiinaada aba heeda miy ng'eanyi, abeeda gwandeawa fuga saang'a was ginealangaaschi ea eemeetuw leabu meatkwajeega sean bea Yudeya, ea Yerusalemu ea ghuuta basooda Diro, ea Sidoni, nea ghapka gooleeysiit niny nea geahaap geeyoonung'weaka nyaawa; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.6.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.6.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 6:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghoahaap eara fugiga bearji meangeenda munyasiin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.6.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.6.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 6:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gagasa eemeesean ghawaas niny, aba gideaba uurda gwaleabu headaanyi ak ghoahaap sean.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.6.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.6.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Hooseaneega ea giiseaneega",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 6:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.6.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.6.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 6:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu gagatkat gheanyangaaschi goong'weersa ginealangaaschi, ak gwayeesha:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.6.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.6.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 6:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ghoang'wani agoogeeda barbari, aba gideaba sugoocheanduumeeda ASEETA deang'wa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.6.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.6.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 6:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.6.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.6.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 6:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ghoang'wani agoogeeda yeadeagwa jih ghamneawa, aba gideaba gajoolang'uuda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.6.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.6.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 6:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ghoang'wani agoogeeda ooyeawdi ghamneawa, aba gideaba gajoayaaga reari.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.6.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.6.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 6:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.6.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.6.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 6:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ghoang'wani agoogeeda sideagwa buuneeda, nea gwahistaneegwa nea goong'eaweegwa ak geemunyasiidi gheawungeagwa, aba badayda Orjeeda Siida! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.6.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.6.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 6:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahoosana aba eaweedida, nea ghoang'waschi aba hooseaneega, aba gideaba giimeardeang'wa aahaw aba humng'eeda, aba gideaba nih gidaghayi hinda ghweaniga nyaawa sibanga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.6.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.6.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 6:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.6.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.6.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
