          "text": "Nea siida iiy ng'asheegeasu ak ea masina gawuurji siida deeksa gheeda badayda ng'eanyiida nea manda sindeeta; hidu guldeayda, deagheata ghabwaay, ak habitkweedeaba gheedida aahaw muuchi.”",
